<title>USA: Campbell-Savona CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt. [CORRECTED 17:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Campbell-Savona CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt. [CORRECTED 17:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $8 million of Campbell-Savona Central School District, N.Y., school bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.7061 percent (corrects from 5.70 percent).</p>
</text>
